00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:38.650
which is involved with these very, uh, fast
acting brain rewarding products that is in

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:39.880
a category by itself.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:44.410
Can you, well, I want to talk about what's
happening in the brain when, when the social

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.590
media dopamine hits are happening.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:51.380
But before we do that, can you give us a couple
