00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.160
harm, most obvious harm being increased.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.450
Reese risk of skin cancer.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:32.930
So yeah, there are other, other kinds of,
um, addictive behaviors out there.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:38.000
So let's talk a little bit now about, uh,
the, the, the, the dopamine release that exists

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.870
with a lot of these variable rewards systems.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:46.410
So as I understand it, you have a Facebook
account, email falls under this, um, uh, notifications

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.770
on Instagram, whatever the case may be.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:54.180
You don't know at any particular point in
