hands.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:48.970
And um, you're right, you don't know what's
gonna come across the screen.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.750
And a lot of it is rewarding.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:55.610
And the fact that it's variable reinforcement
also is a big part of it.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:07:01.531
How do we consider the types of, or I guess
before we even get to that, I mean, so, so

